# Agent configuration. The committed parts — skills and any shared settings —
# are shared repository contract. Everything else under .claude is per-machine:
# launch.json carries absolute paths to one checkout, and settings.local.json is
# personal permission state.
/.claude/*
!/.claude/skills/
!/.claude/settings.json
